{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act11d0_level_act11d0_08_end",
  "groupId": "act11d0",
  "stageId": "act11d0_08",
  "title": "月光沉淪",
  "storyCode": "TW-8",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5e06c80461fa06e1ad17b5b73fffaefa37cfb17b10f9ee7ec5cadde402345a05",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九尾狐活动 8下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "負傷的鎮民",
      "text": "啊——長官，你在這裡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "負傷的鎮民",
      "text": "聽說你負傷了，你可以下來了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "......咳，這裡傷患很多......再這樣下去，真的沒地方落腳了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "塔佳娜......塔佳娜她怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "負傷的鎮民",
      "text": "我、我也不清楚，聽說有人在她的面前被燒死，她就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "嗚嗚......嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "........哭出來吧，孩子，你沒必要強撐著的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "對、對不起......但是我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "去哭一場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "可現在外面還是一片混亂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "我去......有我在，還有羅德島的各位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "總有辦法的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "不......您難道是想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "帶她去休息，我來指揮戰局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "負傷的鎮民",
      "text": "沒問題......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "伯父......！答應我！不要去送死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "那是沒有意義的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "......連你都說出沒有意義這種話，那可就真沒有意義了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "至少懷著點希望吧......也許事情還有轉機。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "給我——讓開！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "text": "成功了！那些巨像，巨像被粉碎了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "這種執著......真是出乎預料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "泥岩，不該這麼手下留情了，否則我們無法全身而退。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......你眼中滿是仇恨，和茫然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "你在為安托醫生感到憤怒，可那又如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "這裡每個人背負的東西，都不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "住嘴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "不許你......提她的名字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "呃——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "等到饑荒和寒冬來臨，你們還是會戰敗，這是一場無人生還的鬧劇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "沃倫姆德......會滅亡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "這不用你說！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "你在恨誰......？你又想救誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......呃！又是那個法術——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "岩石巨像",
      "text": "嘎啊啊啊啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "亞葉姐姐——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "減緩了泥岩的法術生效時間......真是奇異的技巧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "不過，你還有餘裕分心？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "唔！放、放開我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "你應該慶幸，如果你再大個幾歲，我會毫不猶豫地砍下你持杖的慣用手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "——鈴蘭！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "別想跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "岩石巨像",
      "text": "嘎啊啊啊啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "......你只是個醫生，你不該背對敵人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "塞弗林——！你還不能！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "又一個......戰士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "......真凶，已經被找到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "造成這一切的元兇！叛徒畢德曼！就在剛才，已經被羅德島的幹員們帶回了議事廳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "text": "等等，畢德曼......畢德曼沒死？那是怎麼回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "不要聽他胡言亂語！真凶是誰還重要嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "我們要的是感染者不再被非感染者排擠，窮人不必為貴族賣命！冬靈人可以奪回自己的土地！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "我們是整合運動——我們將開啟新的時代——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "你看，塞弗林，這毫無用處......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "......那就殺了我，整合運動，我們痛痛快快打一場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......然後呢？寒冬和饑荒依舊可以摧毀這座城市。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "不......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "反正橫豎都是死路一條......我寧可相信羅德島可以阻止事情變得更糟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "至少能多活下來一些人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "你看，你遍體鱗傷，面罩都碎了一半，你的巨像分崩離析，你其實很累了，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "我看得出來......我們同病相憐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "——呃，借個火？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "反正這都是最後一根煙了......算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "（動手，現在，不要讓他們有機會救我。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "——塞弗林·霍索恩，你死後，我會撤離這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "這只是一座幾近荒廢的城鎮，留在這裡，只是等死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "你的死，給他們交代。如若他們還想殘害他人，我自會處置。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "......這就夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "——永別。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......這法術，這是什麼力量......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "——您、您為什麼......一定要送死？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "讓開，小姑娘！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "您不該死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "那就會有更多人死——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "喂！泥岩好像遇到麻煩了！趕緊去幫他！不要讓他們喘息！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "但、但他們連巨像都能打碎......這也太......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斷崖",
      "text": "......乖乖放棄吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斷崖",
      "text": "連薩卡茲都失敗了，你們還要靠什麼戰鬥？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "——嘖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斷崖",
      "text": "如果只是趁機發洩不滿的話......好啊，我奉陪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斷崖",
      "text": "我們奉陪到底。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "快，快啟動剩下的“留聲機”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "我、我不懂萊塔尼亞的源石技藝，快去找個萊塔尼亞人......慢著，頭頂那是什麼，無人機！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "別看頭頂！看你背後！有個眼睛通紅的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "text": "......勸你們別亂動哦，灰喉姐可是盯著你們的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "text": "哎......也別回頭去找灰喉姐的位置，我也盯著你們啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......你們憤怒，你們保護。這是第幾次了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "你們......呵，你們居然真的贏了我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "把武器放下，這次不會放水了，泥岩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "你們......你們這樣會讓他們依舊記恨沃倫姆德！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "與任何立場都無關，他們並非真正渴求變革，他們只是把自己的利益凌駕於其他人之上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "因為他們沒有選擇共渡難關，也不願意知曉真相，他們只想要......在混亂中掠奪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "塔佳娜小姐說的對，即使你犧牲自己，也是徒勞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "不管背後的問題多麼複雜，羅德島的幹員絕不會坐視感染者......毀掉一座城鎮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......一座安托想要保護的城鎮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "羅德島的行動小隊將死守這處廣場，這座議事廳大樓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "的確，也許這會造成更多的傷亡......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "但那是在這之後，在“你們”，和“我們”之後。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "只要我們還在，就必須抗爭到最後一刻......為了讓安托，瞑目。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者們",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......你們，確實戰勝了我......也許你們確實可以死守這座塔樓......但意義是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "很多人都會死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "會像安托一樣......死得毫無意義。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "感染者有抗爭的理由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "理由永遠會被正當化......但至少現在，你們沒有在解決問題，你們只是在破壞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "在沃倫姆德遭受天災之後，在補給告急缺乏人手的現在......你們做了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "告訴我啊，你們做了什麼！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "——我說過了，別動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "你的源石技藝已經漏洞百出，現在這個距離，即使只是我的弩箭也足夠讓你失去行動能力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......羅德島。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "是什麼導致了那場火災，那場火災又導致了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......罪魁禍首，已經死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......是嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "——我們撤退。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者們",
      "text": "什麼？但我們......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "我說了，撤退。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "只是小部分的人的話......有辦法穿過大裂谷，回到溫暖的地帶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "無論你們是想要奪回土地還是報復富人......最後都只會在凍土上遇難。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "你們是想靠怒火度過冬天，還是想靠無辜者的屍體生火取暖？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "既然真凶已死，那麼我們理應撤退。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "text": "但、但我們要搶奪的是沃倫姆德！是我們的土地！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "閉嘴，冬靈人。你想要的只是權利，舒舒服服地躲在強者後面撿破爛的權利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "不要質疑領袖，學聰明點，否則就把你丟在廢土上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "......這不是你一句話就能解決的！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "我們死了這麼多人！難道就因為幾句話就要夾著尾巴離開嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......讓他安靜，朋友們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嘎嗷嗷嗷——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "唔啊——唔啊啊啊——這——拳頭——！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "從地底伸出的石拳......你還有餘力嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "不要用這麼激烈的手段制止他們，至少剛才為止他們和我們還是一邊的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "我本來只想嚇他們一下的......算了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "你也別老是把自己的源石技藝造物叫做朋友啊，聽起來怪可怕的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......你可以當沒聽見。別這麼囉嗦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "聽著，撤退是我的判斷。我沒有命令你們所有人的能力，但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "我會離開。願意跟隨我的人也會離開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "剩下的人......你們自求多福。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "對了......你有火柴嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "如果沒受潮的話，剛才那幾個術師可真麻煩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "給那邊的塞弗林長官，遞個火。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "戰敗者......能活著退出戰場，已是萬幸，不要再磨蹭了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "嘁！那就不要管什麼整合運動了！打下議事廳是遲早的事，這座城鎮需要我們做主——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "投降吧，塞弗林！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "......我就說，他們不會輕易收手的，咳咳——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "注意左側！他們來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "長官，躲在我身後。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......一群瘋子，嘖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "絕對，不允許你們，踐踏羅德島保護的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "他們在準備施法，準備防禦，擊破施術者——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "什、什麼？擋下了我的源石技藝？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "你們為什麼要來礙事——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "——領袖有令。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "就算要和你們打，我們也不會輕易放棄，魔族！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "......嚯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "發生什麼了，他們怎麼起了內訌......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "等等......泥岩他......停下了腳步？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "領袖？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......土壤啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "站......起來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "停下，泥岩，你在縮短自己的壽命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......無所謂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "沒必要使用那麼古老的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "我說了......站起來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幾乎所有的廢墟都凝結在一起。\n那是一個巨人，它遙望著遠方的山脈。\n他，泥岩，一動不動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "好、好高！好大！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......強弩之末罷了，它的身軀在崩潰，他在勉強自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "後退，不要貿然進攻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "不，不對......泥岩的確已經沒有這個力氣了，但是這法術......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "這其中有著薩卡茲的......巫術？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "（我說了——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "岩石巨像",
      "text": "我說了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "你在做一件很危險的事情，你把你的生命分享給了自己的造物，如果只是為了威懾，這不值得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "......行吧，聽你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "（從仇恨和紛爭裡脫身，活下去，現在是離開這裡的最後機會。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "岩石巨像",
      "text": "離開這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "（還想戰鬥的人......就是想將所有人置於死地。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "岩石巨像",
      "text": "那麼......先來摧毀我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "先來打敗......我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "他、他怎麼......他不是來幫我們的人嗎！他不是整合運動嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "......我、我才不管！那就讓他去死吧！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "過去......我們幫助你們。因為那場火災，我們都心懷憤懣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "我們認同你們，引導你們，我們追求的不是他們的死，而是我們的生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "很遺憾，現在，我們似乎不站在同一邊了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "......殺害平民和羅德島的戰士，讓我們心有憂慮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "但如果是對付不聽命令的暴徒......我們何必手下留情？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "對付任何人，我們，薩卡茲，“魔族佬”，都綽綽有餘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "綽綽有餘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斷崖",
      "text": "發生什麼了？自從那個巨像出現之後，聲音就停下了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "text": "那個、山一樣的巨像也是源石技藝嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斷崖",
      "text": "......想辦法和亞葉她們會合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "......嘁！該死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "走，我們走，這座城鎮已經死了，在冬天來臨前找到翻過大裂谷的路才能活下去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "放棄這座城鎮吧，冬靈的同胞，窮人和感染者們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "自會有別處迎接我們的怒火，就讓沃倫姆德坐以待斃吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "......在這裡和薩卡茲衝突也沒有任何好處，撤退。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "我們走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "泥岩，夠了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "呼啊——哈、哈——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "他們已經停手了......真荒唐，我們怎麼變成了勸架的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "看看這座城鎮......我們，帶來了混亂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "非你我本意，但抗爭本就是利己的，沒有那麼多人心懷什麼偉大事業。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "你說的對......那我們究竟要如何對待我們的鬥爭......以及死去的同胞？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "痛苦和糾葛時刻伴隨著我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "呃，等我一下......我好像摸著火柴了，備用的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "喂，憲兵，接著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "嗯......薩卡茲的戰士也會抽煙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "不過我已經戒煙了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "text": "唔嗯，看來每個戒煙的人都會帶著火柴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......撿來的命，好好珍惜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "至於你們，羅德島......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......那麼，就此別過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "也許......也許你們能想辦法幫助剩下的這些人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "但那些事，都和薩卡茲無關了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在岩石的崩塌聲中，薩卡茲們轉過了頭。\n街道在燃燒。\n暴徒離去，沒有再發生衝突的唯一原因，僅僅是恐懼和威懾。\n最後一塊碎石落地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
